{"availability":"available","full":"babarot/oksskolten","name":"oksskolten","description":"🏔️ The AI-native RSS reader","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":486,"forks":61,"created":"2026-03-10T06:29:20Z","updated":"2026-07-12T08:35:17Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://oksskolten.com","topics":["ai","llm","news-reader","react","rss","rss-feed","rss-reader","self-hosted","selfhosted","typescript"],"demo":"https://demo.oksskolten.com/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:08.366Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:08.366Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:08.366Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T21:33:08.366Z","stars":486,"forks":61}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Oksskolten (pronounced \"ooks-SKOL-ten\") — every article, full text, by default.","Most RSS readers show what the feed gives you — a title and maybe a summary. Some (like Miniflux and FreshRSS) can fetch full article text, but it's opt-in per feed and requires configuration. Oksskolten does it for every article automatically: it fetches the original article, extracts the full text using Mozilla's Readability + 500 noise-removal patterns, converts it to clean Markdown, and stores it locally. No per-feed toggles, no manual CSS selectors — it just works.","Because Oksskolten always has the complete text, AI summarization and translation produce meaningful results, full-text search actually covers everything, and you never need to leave the app to read an article."],"features":["Full-Text Extraction — Every article is fetched from its source and processed through Readability + 500 noise-removal patterns. You read complete articles inside Oksskolten, never needing to click through to the…","AI Summarization & Translation — On-demand article processing via Anthropic, Gemini, or OpenAI with SSE streaming. Works on full article text, not RSS excerpts","Interactive Chat — Multi-turn AI conversations with MCP tooling; search articles, get stats, and ask questions about your feeds","Full-Text Search — Meilisearch-powered search across your entire article archive","Smart Fetching — Adaptive per-feed scheduling, conditional HTTP requests (ETag/Last-Modified), content-hash deduplication, exponential backoff, and tracking parameter removal"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/babarot/oksskolten/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"cd41249f7bfadc4da8a3a333751af1b7b3f7ba4cba7c1aa1e480e22f23091950","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:08.490Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:08.490Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Oksskolten (pronounced \"ooks-SKOL-ten\") — every article, full text, by default.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/babarot/oksskolten/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"cd41249f7bfadc4da8a3a333751af1b7b3f7ba4cba7c1aa1e480e22f23091950","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/babarot/oksskolten/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:08.490Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-07-12T08:35:17Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/babarot/oksskolten/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:08.491Z","hash":"cd41249f7bfadc4da8a3a333751af1b7b3f7ba4cba7c1aa1e480e22f23091950","originalBytes":12918,"storedBytes":12918,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["article","rss","oksskolten","docker","fastify","feed","search","sqlite","api","feeds","fetcher","full","chat","every","full-text","tunnel","build","extraction","via","anthropic","bridge","compose","content","fetch","gemini","only","openai","readability","text","app","articles","bash","cloudflare","container","cron","css","database","deployment","enterprise","flaresolverr","freshrss","http","mcp","miniflux","password","port","pro+","runs","seed","spa","tracking","url","without","adaptive","agpl-3.0","archive","automatically","built-in","compose.prod.yaml","demo","each","etag","free","github","image","jso